Package: com.duoface.carplay.nativescenehost
Name: DuoFace Native Dashboard Scene Host (Development)
Version: 0.0.2~template1
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Section: Development
Maintainer: DuoFace Independent
Depends: firmware (>= 16.0)
Description: Independent native host with UIKit and a standards-compliant CarPlay template scene for properly entitled applications. This build does not grant an Apple CarPlay category entitlement, bypass application admission, mirror iPhone apps, or change the system Dock; staging only.
